WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.022
You can write down your words before you make an appointment call.

2
00:00:04.022 --> 00:00:07.800
Write the phone number and the reason for your call on a note.

3
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:12.126
Call when you feel ready. Someone you trust can sit nearby if you want.

4
00:00:12.126 --> 00:00:15.843
Say your name, then say, I would like to book an appointment.

5
00:00:15.843 --> 00:00:19.316
Ask the person to repeat the date or time if you need to.

6
00:00:19.316 --> 00:00:22.972
Write down the details, then say thank you and end the call.

7
00:00:22.972 --> 00:00:28.250
You can use a script, ask someone to help, or try again later.
